<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>P&T AI Studio</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #030617;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .app {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px 0 25px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: bold;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,#00d9ff,#a020ff,#ff27d9);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .tagline {
      color: #eee;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .search {
      border: 2px solid #00d9ff;
      border-radius: 35px;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      background: #080b25;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .categories {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .cat {
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 1px solid #684cff;
      border-radius: 25px;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      background: #080b25;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .card {
      min-height: 150px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg,#081f55,#35105d);
      border: 2px solid #18cfff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0,180,255,.25);
    }

    .card:nth-child(2) {
      border-color: #ff2bea;
    }

    .card:nth-child(3) {
      border-color: #ffae00;
    }

    .card:nth-child(4) {
      border-color: #22e89a;
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .desc {
      color: #ccc;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .recent {
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .recent h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .bottom {
      margin-top: 30px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      padding: 15px 5px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      background: #080d2a;
      border: 1px solid #164fbb;
    }

    .nav {
      text-align: center;
      color: #ddd;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .plus {
      font-size: 30px;
      color: #ff35ed;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="app">

  <header>
    <div class="logo">P&T</div>
    <div class="tagline">Create Your Story with AI</div>
  </header>

  <div class="search">
    ✨ သင်လိုချင်တာ / အိုင်ဒီယာ ရေးသွင်းပါ...
  </div>

  <div class="categories">
    <div class="cat">🔥 လူကြိုက်များ</div>
    <div class="cat">⭐ အသစ်များ</div>
    <div class="cat">💗 နာမည်ကြီး</div>
    <div class="cat">✨ AI Tools</div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🖼️</div>
      <div class="title">AI Image</div>
      <div class="desc">စာရေးပြီး ပုံဖန်တီးပါ</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🎬</div>
      <div class="title">Image to Video</div>
      <div class="desc">ပုံကို Video အဖြစ်ပြောင်းပါ</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">✍️</div>
      <div class="title">Text to Video</div>
      <div class="desc">စာမှ Video ဖန်တီးပါ</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🎙️</div>
      <div class="title">AI Voice</div>
      <div class="desc">AI အသံဖန်တီးပါ</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">🎵</div>
      <div class="title">Music & SFX</div>
      <div class="desc">Music နှင့် Sound Effects</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="icon">📁</div>
      <div class="title">My Projects</div>
      <div class="desc">သင့် Project များ</div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="recent">
    <h2>⭐ နောက်ဆုံးဖန်တီးထားသောများ</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom">
    <div class="nav">🏠<br>ပင်မစာမျက်နှာ</div>
    <div class="nav">🔍<br>ရှာဖွေမည်</div>
    <div class="nav plus">＋</div>
    <div class="nav">🖼️<br>ဖန်တီးထားသည်</div>
    <div class="nav">👤<br>Profile</div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html်။
